      "year": 2021,
      "text": "Some people suggest anti-obesity measures such as displaying calorie information in restaurant menus. Such measures sidestep addressing the core problems that cause obesity: poverty and income inequality. Which one of the following statements summarizes the passage? 11.17.11 11.17.12 11.17.13 11.17.14",
